  "prefLabel": "Rev 2909.03 Response to Form CD-410, “Settlement Agreement Offer”",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2909.03 Response to Form CD-410, “Settlement Agreement Offer”.\n\n(a) Within 60 days of the department’s receipt of a completed Form CD-410, the department shall request from the taxpayer any additional information required to evaluate the settlement agreement offer.\n\n(b) Within 60 days of the department’s receipt of a completed Form CD-410, or the receipt of the additional information requested in accordance with (a) above, whichever is later, the department shall, pursuant to Rev 2909.02 (b):\n\n(1) Accept the settlement agreement offer; or\n\n(2) Reject the settlement agreement offer by setting forth the reasons for such rejection.\n\nSource. #10680, eff 10-2-14; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2900.html"
